{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given an integer array `nums`, return `true` if any value appears **at least twice**, and `false` if every value is distinct."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/e3cf0c31-b2b2-4835-8c04-d924ee594da2.svg",
      "alt": "1, 2, 3, 1 sorted becomes 1, 1, 2, 3. The two 1s, far apart before, are now neighbours, so comparing each value with the one before it finds the duplicate.",
